<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <title>ABB ZScaler Verification Page</title>
</head>

<body bgcolor="#f5f5f5" style="font-family: verdana; font-size: 90%;">


    <br /><br />
    <span id="content-email" style="display: none;">
        <div id="title-div" style="background-color: red; margin-left: 10%; margin-right: 10%;padding-top: 1%;padding-bottom: 1%;padding-left: 1%; align-items: end; display: grid; color:white;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;">
            <div style="width:80%;float:left">Caution</div>
            <div style="width:90%; text-align:right"></div>
        </div>
        <div style="background-color: white; margin-left: 10%; margin-right: 10%;padding-top: 1%;padding-bottom: 1%;padding-left: 1%;">
            <h3>This page is blocked:</h3>
            <b><a style="color:red" id="block-url-email"></a></b>
            <p>Reason: <span id="block-reason-email"></span></p>
            <p>
                According to ABB Security Policies and Standards, access to this page has been restricted. Please submit
                an
                <a href="https://abbnow.service-now.com/cs_gr?id=sc_cat_item&sys_id=d0d7e6318738759813a564230cbb357f"
                   style="color:red" id="unblock-link">Unblocking Request</a> if you need access for business purpose
                only.
            </p>
            </p> Check out best practices on using external webmail tools on <a id="inside-link"
                                                                                href="https://go.insideplus.abb.com/information-systems/gf-is/scenarios/be-secure/use-external-web-tools-securely"
                                                                                style="color:red">Inside+</a>.
            </p>
            <p>&nbsp;</p>
            <hr style="width:95%" />
            <img id="company-logo3" src=""
                 alt="" style="width:15%;height:15%; display: block;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto;">
        </div>
    </span>
    <span id="content-fileshare" style="display: none;">
        <div id="caution-div" style="background-color: red; margin-left: 10%; margin-right: 10%;padding-top: 1%;padding-bottom: 1%;padding-left: 1%; align-items: end; display: grid; color:white;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;">
            <div style="width:80%;float:left">Caution</div>
            <div style="width:90%; text-align:right"></div>
        </div>
        <div style="background-color: white; margin-left: 10%; margin-right: 10%;padding-top: 1%;padding-bottom: 1%;padding-left: 1%;">
            <h3>This page is blocked: </h3>
            <b><a style="color:red" id="block-url-fileshare"></a></b>

            <p>Reason: <span id="block-reason-fileshare"></span></p>
            <p>
                According to ABB Security Policies and Standards, access to this page has been restricted. Please submit
                an
                <a id="unblocking-link-req2"
                   href="https://abbnow.service-now.com/cs_gr?id=sc_cat_item&sys_id=d0d7e6318738759813a564230cbb357f"
                   style="color:red">Unblocking Request</a> if you need access for business purpose only.
            </p>
            </p> Check out best practices on using external webmail tools on <a id="inside-link-2"
                                                                                href="https://go.insideplus.abb.com/information-systems/gf-is/scenarios/be-secure/use-external-web-tools-securely"
                                                                                style="color:red">Inside+</a>.
            </p>
            <p>&nbsp;</p>
            <hr style="width:95%" />
            <img id="company-logo1" src=""
                 alt="" style="width:15%;height:15%; display: block;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto;">
        </div>
    </span>
    <span id="content-generic" style="display: none;">
        <div id="caution-div2" style="background-color: red; margin-left: 10%; margin-right: 10%;padding-top: 1%;padding-bottom: 1%;padding-left: 1%; align-items: end; display: grid; color:white;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;">
            <div style="width:80%;float:left">Caution</div>
            <div style="width:90%; text-align:right"></div>
        </div>
        <div style="background-color: white; margin-left: 10%; margin-right: 10%;padding-top: 1%;padding-bottom: 1%;padding-left: 1%;">
            <h3>Page Blocked</h3>
            <b><a style="color:red" id="block-url-generic"></a></b><br /><br />
            <p id="generic-text">
                Access to this page has been restricted according to the ABB Security Policies and
                Standards. If you feel
                this is in error, you may submit an <a id="unblocking-link-req3" style="color:red"
                                                       href="https://abbnow.service-now.com/cs_gr?id=sc_cat_item&sys_id=d0d7e6318738759813a564230cbb357f">
                    Unblocking
                    Request
                </a>.
            </p>
            <p id="generic-text-whatsapp" style="display: none;">
                Access to this Whatsapp has been restricted according
                to the ABB Security Policies and Standards. Any deviations from policy must be go through exception
                request with Business Justification. You may submit an <a id="unblocking-link-req3wap" style="color:red"
                                                                          href="https://abbnow.service-now.com/cs_gr?id=sc_cat_item&sys_id=d0d7e6318738759813a564230cbb357f">
                    Unblocking
                    Request
                </a>.
            </p>
            <p>&nbsp;</p>
            <hr style="width:95%" />
            <img id="company-logo2" src=""
                 alt="" style="width:15%;height:15%; display: block;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto;">
        </div>
    </span>
    <span id="content-ai" style="display: none;">
        <div id="ack-div" style="background-color: red; margin-left: 10%; margin-right: 10%;padding-top: 1%;padding-bottom: 1%;padding-left: 1%; align-items: end; display: grid; color:white;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;">
            <div style="width:80%;float:left">
                Acknowledgment required
            </div>
            <div style="width:90%; text-align:right"></div>
        </div>        
        <div style="background-color: white; margin-left: 10%; margin-right: 10%;padding-top: 1%;padding-bottom: 1%;padding-left: 1%;">
            <div>
                <h3>
                    You're accessing:
                </h3>
                <b><a style="color:red" id="block-url-ai"></a></b>
            </div>
            <br />
            <span id="copilot-text-abb" style="display:none">Product is not mature and at it is still an exploration tool and not ready for ABB internal use</span>
            <span id="copilot-text-bnr" style="display:none">Product is not mature and at it is still an exploration tool and not ready for B&R internal use</span>
            <p>
                Please bear in mind the following rules when using this service:
            </p>
            <p>
                Do not provide:
                <br />
                <ul>
                    <li>Confidential information, including ABB, customer or supplier information</li>
                    <li>Intellectual property, R&D information, software code</li>
                    <li>ABB-specific data or information that allows an attribution to ABB</li>
                    <li>Personal data</li>

                </ul>
            </p>
            <p>
                Output data/generated content:
                <br />
                <ul>
                    <li>Before using output data, ensure that it is accurate and contains no discriminatory information</li>
                    <li>Do not use any output for ABB products/offerings</li>
                    <li>
                        Content generated by ChatGPT must be attribute to ChatGPT unless the content was substantially
                        modified
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </p>
            <p>&nbsp;</p>

            <button id="ack-btn" onclick="navigate();"
                    style="background-color: red; border: 0cm; padding: 1%; color: white;border-radius: 12px;display: block;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto;">
                Acknowledge
                and proceed
            </button>
            <br /><br />
            <hr style="width:95%" />
            <img id="company-logo4" src=""
                 alt="" style="width:15%;height:15%; display: block;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto;">
        </div>
    </span>
    <span id="content-deepseek" style="display: none;">
               
        <div style="background-color: white; margin-left: 10%; margin-right: 10%;padding-top: 1%;padding-bottom: 1%;padding-left: 1%;">
            <div>
                <h3>
                    You're accessing:
                </h3>
                <b><a style="color:red" id="block-url-deepseek"></a></b>
            </div>
            <br />
            <span id="deepseek-text-abb" style="display:none">Deepseek is not available for use within ABB. Feel free to explore other AI tools which are approved for your use. <a id="unblocking-link-req2"
                href="https://search.abb.com/library/Download.aspx?DocumentID=9AKK108469A7269&LanguageCode=en&DocumentPartId=&Action=Launch"
                style="color:red">(Read more here)</a></span>
            
            <span id="deepseek-text-bnr" style="display:none">Deepseek is not available for use within B&R. Feel free to explore other AI tools which are approved for your use. </span>

            <p>&nbsp;</p>

            
            <br /><br />
            <hr style="width:95%" />
            <img id="company-logodeepseek" src=""
                 alt="" style="width:15%;height:15%; display: block;margin-left: auto;margin-right: auto;">
        </div>
    </span>


    <script>
        var url;
	    const ipRegex = /^https?:\/\/((25[0-5]|(2[0-4]|1\d|[1-9]|)\d)\.){3}(25[0-5]|(2[0-4]|1\d|[1-9]|)\d)(:\d+)?\/?$/;
	    const fqdnRegex = /^https?:\/\/(?=.{1,255}$)(?:[a-zA-Z0-9](?:[a-zA-Z0-9-]{0,61}[a-zA-Z0-9])?\.)+[a-zA-Z]{2,}(:\d+)?\/?$/;
        window.onload = function () {
            var match,
                pl = /\+/g,  // Regex for replacing addition symbol with a space
                search = /([^&=]+)=?([^&]*)/g,
                decode = function (s) { return decodeURIComponent(s.replace(pl, " ")); },
                query = window.location.search.substring(1);

            urlParams = {};
            while (match = search.exec(query))
                urlParams[decode(match[1])] = decode(match[2]);
            const isValidUrl = fqdnRegex.test(urlParams["url"]) || ipRegex.test(urlParams["url"]);
            url = "";
			if (typeof urlParams["url"] !== "undefined") {
				if (isValidUrl) {
					document.getElementById('block-url-email').innerHTML = urlParams["url"];
					document.getElementById('block-url-fileshare').innerHTML = urlParams["url"];
					document.getElementById('block-url-generic').innerHTML = urlParams["url"];
					document.getElementById('block-url-ai').innerHTML = urlParams["url"];
					document.getElementById('block-url-deepseek').innerHTML = urlParams["url"];
					url = urlParams["url"];
				}
				else {
					const urlFQDNPart = urlParams["url"].replace(/(https?:\/\/[^\/]+).*/, '$1');
					document.getElementById('block-url-email').innerHTML = urlFQDNPart;
					document.getElementById('block-url-fileshare').innerHTML = urlFQDNPart;
					document.getElementById('block-url-generic').innerHTML = urlFQDNPart;
					document.getElementById('block-url-ai').innerHTML = urlFQDNPart;
					document.getElementById('block-url-deepseek').innerHTML = urlFQDNPart;
					url = urlFQDNPart;
				}
			}
            if (typeof urlParams["reason"] !== "undefined") {
                document.getElementById('block-reason-email').innerHTML = urlParams["reason"];
                document.getElementById('block-reason-fileshare').innerHTML = urlParams["reason"];
            }            
            if (typeof urlParams["cat"] !== "undefined") {

                if (urlParams["cat"] === "Webmail")
                    document.getElementById('content-email').style.display = "inline";
                else if (urlParams["cat"] === "FileHost")
                    document.getElementById('content-fileshare').style.display = "inline";
                else if (urlParams["cat"] === "AI") {
                    document.getElementById('content-ai').style.display = "inline";
                    if (url.indexOf('copilot.microsoft.com') > -1 || url.indexOf('www.bing.com/chat?q=Bing AI') > -1) {
                        
                        if (typeof urlParams["user"] !== "undefined") {
                            if (((urlParams["user"]).toLowerCase().indexOf("br-automation.com") == (urlParams["user"]).toLowerCase().length - 17)) {
                                document.getElementById('copilot-text-bnr').style.display = "inline";
                            }
                            else {

                                document.getElementById('copilot-text-abb').style.display = "inline";
                            }
                        }
                        else{
                            
                            document.getElementById('copilot-text-abb').style.display = "inline";
                        }
                    }
                }
                else if (urlParams["cat"] === "Generative AI and ML Applications") {
                    if (url.indexOf('deepseek.com') > -1) {                        
                        document.getElementById('content-deepseek').style.display = "inline";
                        if (typeof urlParams["user"] !== "undefined") {
                            if (((urlParams["user"]).toLowerCase().indexOf("br-automation.com") == (urlParams["user"]).toLowerCase().length - 17)) {                                
                                document.getElementById('deepseek-text-bnr').style.display = "inline";
                            }
                            else {

                                document.getElementById('deepseek-text-abb').style.display = "inline";
                            }
                        }
                        else{
                            
                            document.getElementById('deepseek-text-abb').style.display = "inline";
                        }
                    }
		else {
                        document.getElementById('content-generic').style.display = "inline";
                    }

                }
                else {
                    document.getElementById('content-generic').style.display = "inline";
                    if (url.indexOf('web.whatsapp.com') > -1) {
                        document.getElementById('generic-text-whatsapp').style.display = "inline";
                        document.getElementById('generic-text').style.display = "none";
                    }
                    else {
                        document.getElementById('generic-text-whatsapp').style.display = "none";
                        document.getElementById('generic-text').style.display = "inline";
                    }
                }

            }
            else {
                document.getElementById('content-generic').style.display = "inline";
                if (url.indexOf('web.whatsapp.com') > -1) {
                    document.getElementById('generic-text-whatsapp').style.display = "inline";
                    document.getElementById('generic-text').style.display = "none";
                }
                else {
                    document.getElementById('generic-text-whatsapp').style.display = "none";
                    document.getElementById('generic-text').style.display = "inline";
                }
            }
            if (typeof urlParams["user"] !== "undefined") {
                //if ((urlParams["user"]).toLowerCase().endsWith("br-automation.com")) {
                if (((urlParams["user"]).toLowerCase().indexOf("br-automation.com") == (urlParams["user"]).toLowerCase().length - 17)) {
                    document.getElementById('company-logo1').src = "https://zscalernotification.abb.com/logos/bnr.jpg";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo1').alt = "B&R Logo";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo2').src = "https://zscalernotification.abb.com/logos/bnr.jpg";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo2').alt = "B&R Logo";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo3').src = "https://zscalernotification.abb.com/logos/bnr.jpg";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo3').alt = "B&R Logo";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo4').src = "https://zscalernotification.abb.com/logos/bnr.jpg";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo4').alt = "B&R Logo";
                    document.getElementById('company-logodeepseek').src = "https://zscalernotification.abb.com/logos/bnr.jpg";
                    document.getElementById('company-logodeepseek').alt = "B&R Logo";
                    document.getElementById('title-div').style.backgroundColor = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('caution-div').style.backgroundColor = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('caution-div2').style.backgroundColor = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('ack-div').style.backgroundColor = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('ack-btn').style.backgroundColor = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('block-url-ai').style.color = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('block-url-email').style.color = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('unblock-link').style.color = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('inside-link').style.color = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('block-url-fileshare').style.color = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('unblocking-link-req2').style.color = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('inside-link-2').style.color = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('block-url-generic').style.color = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('unblocking-link-req3').style.color = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('unblocking-link-req3wap').style.color = "#ff8800";
                    document.getElementById('block-url-ai').style.color = "#ff8800";
                }
                else {
                    document.getElementById('company-logo1').src = "https://seekcdn.com/pacman/company-profiles/logos/432752/abb-logo.png";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo1').alt = "ABB Logo";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo2').src = "https://seekcdn.com/pacman/company-profiles/logos/432752/abb-logo.png";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo2').alt = "ABB Logo";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo3').src = "https://seekcdn.com/pacman/company-profiles/logos/432752/abb-logo.png";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo3').alt = "ABB Logo";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo4').src = "https://seekcdn.com/pacman/company-profiles/logos/432752/abb-logo.png";
                    document.getElementById('company-logo4').alt = "ABB Logo";
                    document.getElementById('company-logodeepseek').src = "https://seekcdn.com/pacman/company-profiles/logos/432752/abb-logo.png";
                    document.getElementById('company-logodeepseek').alt = "ABb Logo";
                }
            }
            else {
                document.getElementById('company-logo1').src = "https://seekcdn.com/pacman/company-profiles/logos/432752/abb-logo.png";
                document.getElementById('company-logo1').alt = "ABB Logo";
                document.getElementById('company-logo2').src = "https://seekcdn.com/pacman/company-profiles/logos/432752/abb-logo.png";
                document.getElementById('company-logo2').alt = "ABB Logo";
                document.getElementById('company-logo3').src = "https://seekcdn.com/pacman/company-profiles/logos/432752/abb-logo.png";
                document.getElementById('company-logo3').alt = "ABB Logo";
                document.getElementById('company-logo4').src = "https://seekcdn.com/pacman/company-profiles/logos/432752/abb-logo.png";
                document.getElementById('company-logo4').alt = "ABB Logo";
                document.getElementById('company-logodeepseek').src = "https://seekcdn.com/pacman/company-profiles/logos/432752/abb-logo.png";
                document.getElementById('company-logodeepseek').alt = "ABb Logo";
            }
        }
        function navigate() {
            window.location.href = url;
        }
    </script>



</body>

</html>